name realhats
category Package
revision 63595
shortdesc Put real hats on symbols instead of ^
longdesc This LaTeX package makes \hat put real hats on symbols. The
longdesc package depends on amsmath, calc, graphicx, ifthen, lcg, and
longdesc stackengine.
